71052	Docker cơ bản cho người mới bắt đầu	Khóa học Docker cơ bản cho người mới bắt đầu\nKhóa học giúp bạn nắm vững những khái niệm nền tảng của Docker — công cụ container hóa phổ biến nhất hiện nay. Bạn sẽ học cách cài đặt Docker, xây dựng và quản lý container, tạo image	{Vue.js,Docker,AWS,PostgreSQL,MySQL,Node.js}	2025-12-25 18:23:34.981173	https://learnova.t9tieanh.io.vn/course/c62c894b-76a9-48a4-8713-3f74f93a3746	Docker cơ bản cho người mới bắt đầu\n\nKhóa học Docker cơ bản cho người mới bắt đầu\nKhóa học giúp bạn nắm vững những khái niệm nền tảng của Docker — công cụ container hóa phổ biến nhất hiện nay. Bạn sẽ học cách cài đặt Docker, xây dựng và quản lý container, tạo image\n\nTags: Vue.js, Docker, AWS, PostgreSQL, MySQL, Node.js	{"link": "https://learnova.t9tieanh.io.vn/course/c62c894b-76a9-48a4-8713-3f74f93a3746", "tags": ["Vue.js", "Docker", "AWS", "PostgreSQL", "MySQL", "Node.js"], "created_at": "2025-12-25T18:23:34.981173"}	f	[0.015474141,0.01379398,0.026456391,-0.052917067,0.001292932,-0.0167977,0.0051949187,0.030702367,-0.0039363764,0.014411658,-0.010958195,-0.019708408,0.009042497,0.010536899,0.10229524,0.005967195,0.015366709,-0.0042977114,0.014457444,-0.011944059,-0.019712156,-0.015978782,-0.003137521,-0.0031519507,-0.0024245935,0.002428554,0.02691378,-0.0035789313,0.043804374,0.044338405,-0.01119071,0.011602641,-0.0011484228,-0.0044425116,-0.013075281,0.0033383274,-0.0029296998,0.0044322102,-0.016104262,0.014818427,0.011786183,0.0010894663,-0.0135750035,0.025923414,0.0056531425,0.0032853524,0.0076114465,-0.024337502,-0.00035833853,0.010756985,0.00018140051,-0.0016068255,0.00301813,-0.14190479,-0.006808112,-0.009723872,-0.013272385,-0.02142038,0.022229167,0.01142741,-0.022552144,0.013553693,-0.0054865303,-0.043037068,0.009630149,-0.022711547,-0.0040660356,0.015171418,0.0157639,0.014076441,0.023696713,0.017760571,-0.020119919,-0.010160649,-0.008375662,-0.02406574,0.011495101,-0.02738823,-0.0031293116,0.031118646,-0.015317544,0.0018453388,0.021321842,-